  "content": "\n\n<p>这是适用于 (Neo)Forge 的沉浸式传送门模组。<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里是 Fabric 版本</a></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本描述底部有“重要说明与常见问题解答”部分。请务必抽出时间阅读。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>透过传送门观看，无缝穿越，无需加载界面。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2021/05/12/UlJ3zdESNyZWmxG.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>其他功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523end-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">增强型末地传送门</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523mirrors\" rel=\"nofollow\">镜子</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortal-Customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义传送门创建指令</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDatapack-Based-Custom-Portal-Generation\" rel=\"nofollow\">基于数据包（Datapack）的自定义传送门生成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523world-wrapping-portal\" rel=\"nofollow\">世界环绕传送门</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDimension-Stack\" rel=\"nofollow\">维度堆栈</a></li>\n<li>更多详情请参阅<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>依赖项：</h3>\n<p>本模组的<strong>1.14 和 1.15</strong>版本依赖于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。</p>\n<p>本模组所有&nbsp;<strong>1.19 之后的版本</strong>均依赖于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>联系方式：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/qouteall/ImmersivePortalsModForForge/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">报告问题</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BZxgURK\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>重要说明与常见问题解答：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不建议使用适用于 MC 1.16.x 的版本，因为它们已严重过时，且无法兼容 Forge 的动态维度功能。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>添加新模组时，请务必备份现有世界存档。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>问</strong>：我遇到了与此模组相关的问题，该怎么办？<br><strong>答</strong>：请参阅上方的联系方式部分，在 GitHub 上提交 Issue 和/或在我们的 Discord 服务器中的 #help-forge-version 频道留言。</li>\n<li><strong>问</strong>：[MC 版本号] 什么时候出？<br><strong>答</strong>：准备好了就会发布！请不要反复询问，我知道每个新 MC 版本的发布时间。</li>\n<li><strong>问</strong>：支持哪些 MC 版本？<br><strong>答</strong>：请参阅下方的支持矩阵：</li>\n</ul>\n<table style=\"width:97.3881%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<th style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.14.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.15.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.16.5</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.3</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.20.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:4.72973%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.21.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">开发中</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🚧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">已支持</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">仅应要求提供修复</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">仅接受 Pull Request</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">停止支持</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：</strong></span>支持矩阵中未提及且早于最新支持版本的模组版本<strong>明确不在计划内</strong>。所有晚于最新提及版本的新版本<strong>正在评估中</strong>。<strong>请勿再为此询问</strong>。所有带有 🦊 标记的版本均为 NeoForge 版本。</p>",
